   "textLength": 1613,
   "text": "There are millions of pizza recipes in the world, including the wildly beloved Crispy Cheesy Pan Pizza, our 2020 Recipe of the Year, not to mention convenient delivery options just about everywhere. So why in the world would we choose pizza as our 2026 Recipe of the Year?\nTurns out, despite the many options available, there was still one big pizza-shaped hole to fill: pizza that’s both impossibly ",
