   "textLength": 1426,
   "text": "While we were starting to tinker with sheet-pan pizzas in the Test Kitchen (and having fairly ho-hum results), we were simultaneously testing biscuit recipes using grated butter and Martin Philip’s Croissant Sourdough Bread recipe, which incorporates grated butter through a series of folds. We had also heard about pizza sfogliata, in which pizza dough is laminated with olive oil. Eventually, we th",
